message: "If you use Odiseo CLI in your work, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "Odiseo CLI"
authors:
  - name: "Odiseo"
    website: "https://www.odiseo.help"
    email: "info@odiseo.help"
repository-code: "https://github.com/odiseohelp-app/cli"
url: "https://www.odiseo.help/mcp"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Command-line client for authenticating with the Odiseo SEO MCP service,
  installing its remote Streamable HTTP connection in Codex, Claude Code,
  Cursor or OpenClaw, and checking the MCP connection. Supports OAuth device
  authorization and existing scoped API keys. Requires Node.js 20 or newer
  and an Odiseo account with MCP access. The MIT license applies to this
  client; the hosted service has separate access requirements.
keywords:
  - Model Context Protocol
  - command-line interface
  - OAuth
  - SEO
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24236710
